    "$t": "天后宮天后聖母"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span><span><b>陳昭蓉</b></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit个所在</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有人tsiūnn落了後</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In ê心肝內　就有</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">虔誠　giám硬　巴結</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tu風tshiâng湧　m̄驚艱苦</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">建立家園　認真生活</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我　恬恬</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">為in　消災解厄</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo in　順風順水</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一代一代生湠</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In為我雕金身</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細間廟　大間廟</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">香火盤se̍h　四季不斷</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">為我請封</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">護國庇民妙靈昭應仁慈天后</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">安在一方</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">庇佑萬民</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE4O_Jy99joe5ECXoAR1DuMXEbntujRjjZ1L6ZRyBLk8vGQFGYWIN4xKfUODgSKTbexICUTztu4taCsBKSU3qyKd-WptX8HXXmA0jNyE6gzmFgV5meOiWaobtip_zs0m9jOA6O5T6uqKlPFTUd70YviL8i32bll-yyvGiPJGeCYpmOrVWxuFISbi_m1A/s1424/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%